     [0;90;1m•[0m
     [0;90;1m│[0m [0;96mNote: Nothing in an executable's source directory can be imported, so nothing in it can be tested either: a test suite cannot depend on an executable. Whatever is written there is therefore code no property runs, no golden file pins and no other executable can reuse, and it is the code that decides what the program does. One line naming a function in the library moves all of that somewhere a test can reach it, and costs nothing.[0m
